Diwan depends on third-party Python packages, and it is measured against
third-party models. Each of them carries its own license. THIRD-PARTY.md
lists every locked package with its version, every model named in the
published evidence (docs/probe), and each license as its source published
it. That file is generated by tools/third_party.py.

This repository vendors no third-party source code and no model weights.
